WEBVTT

00:26.160 --> 00:27.990
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:29.920 --> 00:33.480
<i>I escorting Kikuchiyo-san 
to Nijo Castle, and then...</i>

00:49.940 --> 00:50.520
Huh?

00:51.400 --> 00:51.840
What?

00:53.360 --> 00:54.440
Kikuchiyo-san?

00:55.180 --> 00:57.740
Wh-What's wrong? Why so formal?

01:00.520 --> 01:02.380
Wait, who are you?

